OL,3,GNEWSAYoung carer among Make a
OL,4,ADifference Awards finalists
OL,5,
OL,6,FA young carer who raised thousands of
OL,7,Fpounds for charity and a volunteer dog
OL,8,Fhandler who helps find missing people
OL,9,Fare among the finalists for an award
OL,10,Fceremony celebrating local heroes.
OL,12,FThe BBC Radio Solent Make a Difference
OL,13,FAwards has eight categories recognising
OL,14,Fthose who love to make life better for
OL,15,Fothers.
OL,17,FTo date, millions of people have been
OL,18,Finvolved in Make a Difference across
OL,19,FBBC radio stations.
